  "version": "0.17.0-alpha.2",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.2 - 2026-06-24\n\n### Features\n\n- Support two-step keyboard shortcuts for the quick panel, such as a leader key followed by a second key or double-tapping the same combo (#1148)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make the app feel noticeably smoother on older Windows machines and clarify that \"Lightweight Mode\" closes the window while keeping the app running in the background (#1149)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.2 - 2026-06-24\n\n### Features\n\n- 快速面板的快捷键支持两步组合：先按下引导键再加一个键，或者快速双击同一个组合 (#1148)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 让老旧 Windows 机器上应用运行更流畅，并明确「轻量模式」会关闭窗口但保持应用在后台运行 (#1149)",
